  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">B4D ISC H&#xe5;llbarhetsmanagers</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">B4D ISC Sustainability managers - ISC Sustainability managers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Organisationen Institute for Sustainable Communities kommer att       etablera en utbildning f&#xf6;r arbetsledare inom textilindustrin i milj&#xf6;, h&#xe4;lso och s&#xe4;kerhetsrelaterade fr&#xe5;gor. Ett samarbete kommer att        inledas med en bangladeshisk institution, som p&#xe5; l&#xe5;ng sikt kommer att ansvara f&#xf6;r utbildningen. Insatsen kommer att samfinansieras          tillsammans med n&#xe4;ringslivsakt&#xf6;rer under 2013-2016.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The organisation Institute for Sustainable Communities will establish an institutionalised training for middle managers within the textile  industry in Bangladesh together with a Bangladesh institution. The    projecti will be co-funded by private actors and will be implemented  during 2013-2016. The Bangladesh institution will be selected by      approval from Sida.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The goal of this program is to build the capacity of EHS Managers in the RMG sector to reduce the environmental footprint of Bangladeshi factories, enhance their competitive business advantage, and improve the overall health and safety of their workers and of the surrounding communities.  Together, these impacts will support an increase in the number and quality of economic opportunities available to Bangladeshis.</narrative>
  </description>
